  <!-- PART 2C: CLAIMS REALITY -->
  
<div class="rule-section" aria-hidden="true"><div class="rule-arr-l"></div><div class="rule-line"></div><div class="rule-arr-r"></div></div>
<section id="claims-reality">
    <div class="section-label">Part 2C — Claims Reality</div>
    <h2>What group health insurance actually pays for in India</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Most MNCs buy GHI thinking of it as employee health cover. In practice, nearly half the claim value on a typical group policy flows to employees' parents — a dependency structure that has direct implications for how you structure your plan and sub-limits. Data from 18,000+ claims on Plum's platform (Jan 2023–Jan 2024).</p>

