  <!-- PART 2D: MATERNITY -->
  
<div class="rule-section" aria-hidden="true"><div class="rule-arr-l"></div><div class="rule-line"></div><div class="rule-arr-r"></div></div>
<section id="maternity">
    <div class="section-label">Part 2D — Maternity</div>
    <h2>Why maternity cover is the most mispriced benefit in India</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Delivery and postnatal complications are the single largest cause of group health claims in India, at 12% of all claims. Yet most corporate policies offer sub-limits that don't cover actual delivery costs, let alone complications. This is the benefit MNCs most frequently get wrong.</p>

