<div class="rule-section" aria-hidden="true"><div class="rule-arr-l"></div><div class="rule-line"></div><div class="rule-arr-r"></div></div>
<section id="sector">
    <div class="section-label">Part 5 — Sector Notes</div>
    <h2>Sector-specific requirements and EB benchmarks</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Beyond the universal insurance stack, each sector carries regulatory obligations and candidate expectations shaped by what existing employers in that space already offer.</p>

    <div class="table-scroll"><table class="statutory-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Sector</th>
          <th>Regulatory insurance requirement</th>
          <th>EB benchmark (% offering family GHI cover)</th>
