        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Manufacturing / Industrial</strong></td>
          <td>Public Liability mandatory under Public Liability Insurance Act, 1991 for hazardous industries; Product Liability; Erection All Risk (EAR) during construction phase</td>
          <td>73% family GHI cover. Median SI ₹3L — below the cross-sector median.</td>
          <td>Ministry of Environment, DISH</td>
