          <td>CDSCO, MoH</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>SaaS / Business consulting</strong></td>
          <td>PI (E&amp;O) standard; Cyber cover for any SaaS processing customer data in India under DPDP Act 2023</td>
          <td>84% / 72% family GHI cover. Maternity offered by 74% / 65%.</td>
          <td>Client contract, DPDP regulator</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Transportation / Logistics</strong></td>
          <td>Aviation Third-Party Liability (Aircraft Act 1934); Cargo insurance; Marine Open Policy for freight forwarders; WC/EC critical for field operations</td>
          <td>81% family GHI cover. Maternity offered by 66%.</td>
